flowchart TB
    Start([Agent HTTP request arrives])
    Skin{Skin: classify tier}
    Ears{Ears: ambiguous?}
    Shoulders[Shoulders: blast radius]
    Gary{Protocol Gary: audit}
    Sandbox[Tsukuyomi sandbox: simulate]
    Knee{Knee: destructive?}
    Toe{Toe: budget?}
    Forward([Forward to upstream])
    Eyes[Eyes: verify diff]
    Nose[Nose: anomaly window]
    Mem[(Memory: persist)]
    Mouth([Mouth: human])

    Start --> Skin
    Skin -->|Tier 3| Ears
    Skin -->|Tier 1| Knee
    Ears -->|clear| Shoulders
    Ears -->|ambiguous| Mouth
    Shoulders -->|HIGH/CRITICAL| Gary
    Shoulders -->|MEDIUM| Knee
    Gary -->|round 1 fail| Gary
    Gary -->|round 2 pass| Sandbox
    Gary -->|round 2 fail| Mouth
    Sandbox -->|score >= 0.90| Knee
    Sandbox -->|score < 0.90| Mouth
    Knee -->|permit| Toe
    Knee -->|block| Mem
    Toe -->|GREEN| Forward
    Toe -->|AMBER| Forward
    Toe -->|RED| Mouth
    Forward --> Eyes
    Eyes --> Nose
    Nose --> Mem
